     },
     {
      "caption": "A help desk gets 3 calls an hour, on average.",
      "s": 1.029,
      "e": 3.771
     },
     {
      "caption": "How many calls do you expect in 4 hours?",
      "s": 4.121,
      "e": 6.435
     },
     {
      "caption": "12!",
      "s": 12.135,
      "e": 12.701
     },
     {
      "caption": "The average grows with time: 3 an hour, times 4 hours, is 12.",
      "s": 13.051,
      "e": 17.267
     },
     {
      "caption": "Next: how long until the next event? That's the exponential distribution.",
      "s": 17.667,
      "e": 21.919
     },
     {
